; NOSCARF_FIX2.0_KammInletH_10PlatformPlus6InletLayers_10mmHorizontalLines_16Layers
; Separate NOSCARF version: original FIX2.0 files retained unchanged.
; First19 main-part layers and ten remote conditioning passes retain the existing executable commands.
; Upper122 layers use4inletKammNoSCARF.gcode: original E, actual Arachne widths, first2mm/s then4mm/s.
; Four rigid XY alignments; source Z+1.140mm. No inserted startup, calibration or thermal waits.
; NOSCARF refers to the four upper inlets only; lower channel5mm scarfs retained.
; Existing245C nozzle,70C bed,K0.05; source flow0.98 baked into E once.
; EXECUTABLE_BLOCK_START
